{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_rockr_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_rockr_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "六百鎊",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_rockr_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "da00f11fad04b0c4c3cef18beef2b0ae15a4b9103ec1604744d9655b77ab977c",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "公司代表",
      "text": "拿著，趕緊走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的工人",
      "text": "我點了數額就走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "公司代表",
      "text": "總共六百鎊，你擺什麼譜？再說聯合源石工業這麼大的集團，還能欠你一個人的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的工人",
      "text": "我點了數額再走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "公司代表",
      "text": "你愛怎麼樣就怎麼樣吧，我也不急在這一時。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "公司代表",
      "text": "鐵路廢線快兩年，你是最後一個簽補償金清算合約的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的工人",
      "text": "......五八，五九，六十。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "公司代表",
      "text": "（長長的歎息聲）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "公司代表",
      "text": "這事總算是結了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "公司代表",
      "text": "合約你簽好了，錢你也點清了，現在你和公司沒關係了。出去吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的工人",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "公司代表",
      "text": "我們馬上下班，你還磨蹭什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的工人",
      "text": "我只是在想。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "公司代表",
      "text": "想什麼，錢？多一個便士也沒有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的工人",
      "text": "我只是在想公司當年許諾的那些東西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的工人",
      "text": "電影院，公共浴室，托兒所，工作室裡的鹽汽水。有些實現了，有些沒實現。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的工人",
      "text": "但我以前想，已經有的，總不會再變了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "公司代表",
      "text": "你愛想回家想去，趕緊走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的工人",
      "text": "公司向你許諾的是什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "公司代表",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "公司代表",
      "text": "......出去，算我求你，出去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "街燈年久失修，一半已經不亮，另一半無力地閃著，反襯得商業區方向的雪夜一片刺眼的橘黃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "站住。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "工人充耳不聞，還要往前邁步，但一柄小刀已經抵在他的腰間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "劫匪",
      "text": "錢拿出來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的工人",
      "text": "我沒錢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "劫匪",
      "text": "我知道你剛得了一筆錢。拿出來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的工人",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "劫匪",
      "text": "別磨蹭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的工人",
      "text": "你是機務段哪個工作室的？檢修工作室？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "劫匪",
      "text": "你怎麼知——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "劫匪",
      "text": "——不對，別他媽跟個領導似的問這問那，錢拿出來，別逼我動手！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的工人",
      "text": "聊兩句行嗎？你要是真有過不去的坎，我借你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "劫匪",
      "text": "借？你當我沒借過？現在這光景，誰肯借一個病人錢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "劫匪",
      "text": "就算你借我，我還得上嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的工人",
      "text": "可以等你——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "劫匪",
      "text": "別廢話了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "劫匪",
      "text": "我數到三，要錢還是要命，你想好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "劫匪",
      "text": "一......二......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "劫匪",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "劫匪",
      "text": "............三！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "劫匪",
      "text": "我已經數到三了，你別逼我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "劫匪",
      "text": "我的肺已經爛了，我這條命不值錢！我真捅得下去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "劫匪",
      "text": "把錢拿出來！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "劫匪",
      "text": "快點！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "見工人毫無反應，劫匪將手中的刀往前送了送，割開了工人的衣服。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "捅破什麼東西的感覺傳到手上，劫匪的刀尖卻觸電般往後縮了幾寸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "劫匪",
      "text": "你——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "劫匪的話尚未說出口，工人從懷中掏出不甚厚實的信封，隔著自己的肩膀遞了過去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "劫匪如臨大赦，顫抖著手將信封奪過。等到工人轉過身時，歇斯底里的劫匪已經連同補償金消失在了黑夜裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "六百鎊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "工人站了一會，慢慢走到馬路邊，在褲兜裡摸了半天，摸出一根煙來，用僅剩的一根火柴點上了。\n他深深吸一口煙，彷彿醉了一樣蹲下去。\n一點紅光在黑暗中明滅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的工人",
      "text": "羅謝爾，我回來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的工人",
      "text": "羅謝爾？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的工人",
      "text": "羅謝爾·洛克威爾！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的工人",
      "text": "跑哪去了？天黑了，又下著雪，我得找她去——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅謝爾",
      "text": "......爸爸。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的工人",
      "text": "怎麼這麼晚才回家？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅謝爾",
      "text": "我聽鄰居說......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅謝爾",
      "text": "說你被......搶了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的工人",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅謝爾",
      "text": "是真的嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "父親輕輕點了點頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅謝爾",
      "text": "我剛剛到他們說的地方去，那裡已經一個人都沒有了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅謝爾",
      "text": "是誰搶了你？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的工人",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅謝爾",
      "text": "其他區的劫匪不會到我們這裡來的，一定是輕工業區的人，不會錯的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅謝爾",
      "text": "他甚至還知道你今天領補償金！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅謝爾",
      "text": "我一定要讓他被抓起來——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的工人",
      "text": "羅謝爾，算了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅謝爾",
      "text": "算了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的工人",
      "text": "我和他稍微說了幾句話，他也是沒辦法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅謝爾",
      "text": "爸爸！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅謝爾",
      "text": "他要是來好好商量，我們怎麼可能不借給他？可這是搶劫啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅謝爾",
      "text": "萬一他狠下心去，你——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的工人",
      "text": "他下不去手的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的工人",
      "text": "真下得去手的人，會直接在背後用榔頭敲人腦袋，幾個月前那人就是那麼幹的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "羅謝爾打了個寒噤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的工人",
      "text": "他身體實在太糟，現在這種時候，也沒人願意借他錢，他才不得不搶。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的工人",
      "text": "大家都是工友，他只是一時糊塗。等到光景好起來......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅謝爾",
      "text": "真的會有那一天嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的工人",
      "text": "會有的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的工人",
      "text": "忘了嗎？幾年前你過生日，機務段的所有人一起給你用邊角料造了一架無人機，還能飛的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅謝爾",
      "text": "我當然記得。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的工人",
      "text": "不光機務段，其實整個輕工業區的人都是一家人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的工人",
      "text": "他一定會還的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅謝爾",
      "text": "可是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的工人",
      "text": "怎麼，信不過爸爸？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅謝爾",
      "text": "不，不是不信，是今天下午，克拉克阿姨來央求我們借一點吃的，他們家揭不開鍋了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅謝爾",
      "text": "他們家有五個孩子的，你知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的工人",
      "text": "......我知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅謝爾",
      "text": "我以為你晚上會帶補償金回來，就把一整條麵包......全給他們了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的工人",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "兩人相對無言。\n多年前建成的房屋姑且保暖，只有窗縫裡透進來的嗚嗚聲提醒他們，窗外的雪越來越大了，風也刮了起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅謝爾",
      "text": "我再去克拉克阿姨家問問，看看他們還有沒有吃剩的——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的工人",
      "text": "這麼大的風雪，別跑這一趟了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅謝爾",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的工人",
      "text": "我明天再去街上轉轉，看看有沒有廠子還要鍋爐工。實在不行，我還可以做力工活。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅謝爾",
      "text": "可你的腰......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的工人",
      "text": "沒事。哪個工人沒點小傷小病？我這已經算好的了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的工人",
      "text": "不用擔心我，早點睡吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "若干年後"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "自救軍成員",
      "text": "洛洛，這裡還有一個傷患！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "我來了——羅伯遜叔叔？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伯遜",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "自救軍成員",
      "text": "羅伯遜先生，還能站起來嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伯遜",
      "text": "（搖頭）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "自救軍成員",
      "text": "洛洛，我去拿擔架，麻煩你看著他！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "羅伯遜叔叔，您還看到其他受傷的人了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伯遜",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "羅伯遜叔叔？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伯遜",
      "text": "（搖頭）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "沒關係，你先別說話，堅持住，擔架馬上就來！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "自救軍成員",
      "text": "洛洛，我算搞明白薩卡茲這次當街打人的原因了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "所以到底怎麼回事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "自救軍成員",
      "text": "他們在輕工業區搞了個“工作禁令”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "工作也能禁？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "自救軍成員",
      "text": "除了去他們佔領的工廠做工，其餘的雇傭關係全都被禁止了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "這不就是把人逼進他們的工廠裡，把不願給他們工作的人活活餓死嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "自救軍成員",
      "text": "沒錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "自救軍成員",
      "text": "這些人被打，就是因為被薩卡茲發現他們在給非薩卡茲打零工。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "那些家裡沒人的老弱病殘呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "自救軍成員",
      "text": "你覺得他們會管？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "這群魔族佬！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "（深呼吸）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "你去照顧那些傷得輕的人吧，我們的藥還有，省著點用就行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "我去照顧羅伯遜叔叔，他的情況......不太好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "羅伯遜叔叔，這是下午的藥。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "能坐起來嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伯遜",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "羅伯遜叔叔？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伯遜",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "羅伯遜叔叔，該吃藥了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "等等，上午的藥你也沒吃？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伯遜",
      "text": "照顧我......幹什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "只要是倫蒂尼姆工人中的一員，我們就一定會照顧你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "更何況爸爸跟我說過，我們輕工業區的都是一家人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "你又是鐵路機務段的——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "羅伯遜的手緊緊抓住床單，但洛洛並未看見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伯遜",
      "text": "......人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "你說什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伯遜",
      "text": "換......人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "換、換人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "你是說，換個人照顧你？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伯遜",
      "text": "（點頭）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "沒關係的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "我這就去叫其他人來照顧你，但請你一定把藥吃了，好嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伯遜",
      "text": "（閉上雙眼）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "羅伯遜叔叔！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伯遜",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伯遜",
      "text": "（極輕微地點頭）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "自救軍成員",
      "text": "洛洛，傷患們怎麼樣了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "傷都好得差不多了，今天應該都可以回家。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "他們一走，我們也就該轉移了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "自救軍成員",
      "text": "......是啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "自救軍成員",
      "text": "對了，剛才羅伯遜一直在敲床。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "自救軍成員",
      "text": "我給他端水送飯拿藥他都搖頭，也不是要上廁所。他病得說不出話，只是一個勁兒地敲床。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "自救軍成員",
      "text": "我猜他是要你過去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "我馬上去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "洛洛快步走進帳篷，羅伯遜甚至還在無力地敲著床板。\n直到他睜開眼，看到洛洛的身影，單調的敲擊聲才停息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "羅伯遜叔叔，是要我過來嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "沒事的，我來了，我在這裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伯遜",
      "text": "（輕輕拍了拍床）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "要我......坐在床邊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伯遜",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "幾片木板拼起來的床鋪，還沒一個壯實些的人寬。\n洛洛怕坐到羅伯遜，用手在床邊探了探，卻只能摸到堅硬的床板。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "羅伯遜叔叔，我在這裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "聽說你現在已經在按時吃藥了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伯遜",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "這是好事呀。只有這樣，你的傷才能好得......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "羅伯遜的喉嚨裡發出含混的聲響，不成話語，意思卻很明確。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "也對，我說這些幹什麼呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "要不然，我們聊聊以前的事吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伯遜",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "以前爸爸還在的時候，他常跟我說，鐵路是輕工業區的血管。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "原料從鐵路源源不斷地運進工業區，進入工作室和廠房，變成產品，再由鐵路運出工業區，進入整個倫蒂尼姆，整個維多利亞......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "商品是血管中流淌的血液，而鐵路工人則是組成鐵路的......組成鐵路的......那個詞是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "對了，細胞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "細胞親密無間，齊心協力，血液才能暢通無阻，細胞才能從血液的交換中得到養分。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "我想了想，對爸爸說，那麼，火車經過時咣當咣當的聲音，就是輕工業區的脈搏。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伯遜",
      "text": "（喘息聲）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "爸爸想了想，誇我說得好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "後來，火車經過時，我一想到這些話，就覺得火車聲不但不吵，反而像自己的心跳聲一樣，聽著聽著就能靜下心來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "咣當，咣當......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "洛洛輕輕模仿著火車的聲音，羅伯遜安靜地聽著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "再後來，輕工業區的工廠一家接一家地關停，連鐵路也廢了線......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伯遜",
      "text": "（吸氣聲）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伯遜",
      "text": "——咳、咳......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "羅伯遜叔叔？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "對不起，我說著說著就......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伯遜",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "不說傷心事了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "對了，你看！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "這是我的無人機，我叫它洛克十一。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "十一的意思是， 從洛克一號開始，它已經是我的第十一代無人機了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "雖然是隊長用各種東西拼的，比不上商店裡賣的，但這裡面也有我的想法，它們也幫了我好大的忙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "自救軍成立以來，要不是有這些無人機，我們可能已經被薩卡茲抓住了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "這還得感謝你，感謝爸爸在機務段的同事們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伯遜",
      "text": "（急促的呼吸聲）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "記得嗎？我小時候過生日，機務段一起給我用各種邊角料造了一架無人機，核心引擎還是你做的呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "我喜歡得不行。雖然那架無人機飛不高，但我一有空，就讓它懸停在家裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "我看著旋轉的機翼，就會想，等我長大了，一定要造出更大、更好的無人機。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "這樣爸爸就不用日夜守在鍋爐旁邊，羅伯遜叔叔也不用總是在檢修的時候爬上爬下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "大家和和睦睦地生活在一起，下班了一起出去，喝兩瓶啤酒——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伯遜",
      "text": "（含混不清的聲音）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "羅伯遜叔叔？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "羅伯遜的咳嗽聲打斷了洛洛的話。\n洛洛在他眼角看到潮濕的痕跡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "也不說這個了！我——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "羅伯遜再次嘗試說話。他剛發出一點聲音，又被劇烈的咳嗽打斷了。\n等胸口的痙攣稍微緩解一點，羅伯遜費力地抬起剛剛用來敲床的那隻手，在懷中摸索起來。\n摸索了許久，他最終掏出一個小塑膠袋，裡面是裝得滿滿的錢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "錢......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "是......給我的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伯遜",
      "text": "（點頭）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "羅伯遜叔叔，這是你辛辛苦苦存下來的錢，我不能收！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伯遜",
      "text": "（拍了拍床板）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "不行，羅伯遜叔叔，這錢我真的不能收。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "這樣吧，我把錢暫時收起來，等找到你的家人之後再把錢還給他們——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伯遜",
      "text": "（用力搖頭）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "可是！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "羅伯遜渾濁的眼睛懇切地看著洛洛，但洛洛的堅決讓他望而生畏。\n他放棄了。\n他想歎氣，但他做不到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他緩了口氣，再次把手伸入懷中，這次掏出來的，是一個汙跡斑斑的信封。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "信封......信？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "沒問題，信我一定帶到，只是這個錢——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伯遜",
      "text": "（用力敲擊床板）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "......你不是這個意思？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "洛洛把信封翻了過來，上面草草寫著幾個陳舊的字，很久以前就已經被汗水洇開：\n洛克威爾，補償金600鎊。\n洛洛瞪大了眼睛。\n然後，她看到，羅伯遜用盡全身的力氣，把塑膠袋口扯開，花花綠綠的錢撒了一地。\n十鎊的，五鎊的，一鎊的，其間還夾雜著硬幣的閃光。\n那絕對不是公司發補償金時該有的面額，只有一個便士一個便士存起來的錢才會是這樣。\n這就是羅伯遜被薩卡茲打傷最初的，也最根本的原因。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "羅伯遜......叔叔？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "羅伯遜沒有應聲。\n他像個工人一樣，耗盡了這一身血肉裡蘊藏的所有力氣，最後沉默著死去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "垂垂老矣的輕工業區迎來了不知第多少個清晨。\n薩卡茲的工作禁令卓有成效，證據就是天濛濛亮就已經往工廠進發的工人們。\n前些日子，薩卡茲們還會派幾個人來監視他們。\n但薩卡茲們後來發現，這些人如同一群行屍走肉，上工的路上永遠沉默不語，即便沒人看著，也從不會越雷池一步。\n為了勻出更多人手對付城裡此起彼伏的抵抗，薩卡茲已經不再派人監視他們了。\n貧窮和饑餓就是最盡職的監工。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緘默的工人",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緘默的工人",
      "text": "那是......什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒼老的工人",
      "text": "......無人機？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一架東拼西湊的無人機迎面朝他們飛來。\n飛越第一個工人頭頂時，無人機的載貨艙打開，幾張鈔票飛舞著落下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒼老的工人",
      "text": "錢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "無人機搖搖晃晃地飛過每個工人的頭頂，貨艙裡的鈔票和硬幣如同一場奇異而黏稠的雪，均勻地下在每一個工人的頭上、身邊、腳底。\n這場雪的價值，恰好是一個工作半生的人能領到的補償金的數額。\n六百鎊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲頭目",
      "text": "給我搜！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲頭目",
      "text": "今天上午才從人嘴裡榨出這群渣滓的據點，我就不信他們跑得這麼快！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲士兵",
      "text": "報告，一個人都沒有，連東西都沒了，我們只找到了這個。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲頭目",
      "text": "......工業零件的盒子？就這麼放在桌上？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲頭目",
      "text": "你，射它一箭，看看有什麼鬼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲士兵",
      "text": "是！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲士兵",
      "text": "聽聲音像是個空盒子！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲頭目",
      "text": "打開看看！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "薩卡茲士兵小心翼翼地打開零件盒的蓋子。\n沒有炸彈，沒有毒藥，甚至沒有用於示威的匕首。\n裡面是一個揉成一團的髒信封。\n頭目抓起信封展開，信封裡空無一物，背面不知被誰用裁紙刀整整齊齊地裁掉了一塊。\n頭目還不放心，拿著信封，對著微弱的燈光，翻來覆去地看了一會兒。\n除了污漬，上面只有幾點淚痕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "若干年後"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愉快的工人",
      "text": "欸？這不是你第一次給人錢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "是啊。我已經記不清自己把多餘的錢給過多少人了，反正我拿著也用不上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愉快的工人",
      "text": "那、那我收下了？謝謝你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "別客氣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愉快的工人",
      "text": "不過你這習慣也太奇怪了，到底是怎麼養成的？你第一次給人錢是什麼情況？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "第一次？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "text": "那是在自救軍剛成立不久的時候，我救下了爸爸的一個老同事——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "洛洛抬起頭，看著鉛灰色的天空，想著這段故事該從何說起。\n她的餘光忽然瞟到路邊一座剛剛建成的建築，與四周百廢待興的樣子格格不入，樓頂上還豎著一排氣派的霓虹燈大字：\n“聯合源石工業  倫蒂尼姆工業振興總部”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
